call DisplayTimedTextToPlayer(Player(fQG),0.,0.,15.,"  |cffF15F5F▶ 중급|r : |cffFAED7D"+I2S(eE[fQG])+"|r회 / 성공 |cffFAED7D"+I2S(DE[fQG])+"|r회")
call DisplayTimedTextToPlayer(Player(fQG),0.,0.,15.,"  |cffF15F5F▶ 고급|r : |cffFAED7D"+I2S(kE[fQG])+"|r회 / 희귀 |cffFAED7D"+I2S(nE[fQG])+"|r개 / 특별 |cffFAED7D"+I2S(QE[fQG])+"|r개")
