call DisplayTimedTextToPlayer(Player(fQG),0.,0.,15.,"  |cffF15F5F▶ 압살롬|r : |cffFAED7D"+I2S(AE[fQG])+"|r회 / 성공  |cffFAED7D"+I2S(vE[fQG])+"|r회")
call DisplayTimedTextToPlayer(Player(fQG),0.,0.,15.,"◎ 목재도박 : |cffFAED7D"+I2S(R2I(Gw[fQG]))+"|r회 / 성공  |cffFAED7D"+I2S(Nw[fQG])+"|r회")
